        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Jong-suk\n- Works: School 2013, I Can Hear Your Voice, Doctor Stranger, Pinocchio, W\n- Organizations: SBS\n- Dates: 2012, 2013, 2014, 2016\n\nFacts:\n- Lee Jong-suk's breakout role was in \"School 2013\" in 2012.\n- Lee Jong-suk is well known for his role in \"I Can Hear Your Voice\" in 2013.\n- \"Doctor Stranger\" aired on SBS from May 5 to July 8, 2014.\n- Lee Jong-suk is well known for his role in \"Doctor Stranger\" in 2014.\n- Lee Jong-suk is well known for his role in \"Pinocchio\" in 2014.\n- \"Doctor Stranger\" aired on Mondays and Tuesdays at 21:55 for 20 episodes.\n- Lee Jong-suk is well known for his role in \"W\" in 2016.",
